      "html": "<section class=\"fs2-fig\" data-scene=\"fs-mi-rfe-l1\"><span class=\"fs2-kicker\">QUESTION 05 · VISUAL LESSON</span><div class=\"fs2-canvas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 410\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"fs-redesign-5-title fs-redesign-5-desc\"><title id=\"fs-redesign-5-title\">fs redesign 5</title><desc id=\"fs-redesign-5-desc\">Original diagram explaining fs redesign 5</desc><defs><linearGradient id=\"fs-redesign-5-bg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop stop-color=\"#F5FCFD\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#FFFAF2\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"998\" height=\"408\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"url(#fs-redesign-5-bg)\" stroke=\"#DBEAEC\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#578BBC\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\">MUTUAL INFO</text><text x=\"503\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#DDAA52\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RFE</text><text x=\"840\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#188B7D\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\">L1</text><path d=\"M68 316H288M68 316V133\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C9DBDF\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"81\" cy=\"254\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C7BB4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"91\" cy=\"250.8574000186368\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#578BBC\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"101\" cy=\"241.77014954499083\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C7BB4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"111\" cy=\"227.72299317110077\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#578BBC\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"121\" cy=\"210.23815825416636\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C7BB4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"131\" cy=\"191.21039796260473\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#578BBC\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"141\" cy=\"172.70166537012778\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C7BB4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"151\" cy=\"156.717668845707\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#578BBC\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"161\" cy=\"144.99052243002365\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C7BB4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"171\" cy=\"138.79104440264211\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#578BBC\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"181\" cy=\"138.79104440264211\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C7BB4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"191\" cy=\"144.99052243002365\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#578BBC\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"201\" cy=\"156.717668845707\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C7BB4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"211\" cy=\"172.70166537012776\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#578BBC\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"221\" cy=\"191.2103979626047\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C7BB4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"231\" cy=\"210.23815825416634\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#578BBC\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"241\" cy=\"227.72299317110074\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C7BB4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"251\" cy=\"241.77014954499083\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#578BBC\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"261\" cy=\"250.8574000186368\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C7BB4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"271\" cy=\"254\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#578BBC\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"172\" y=\"354\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#627C88\" font-weight=\"680\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Nonlinear link</text><path d=\"M375 149H615\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#DDAA52\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M401 206H587\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#DDAA52\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M433 263H555\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#188B7D\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"502\" y=\"341\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#DDAA52\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Remove, refit</text><path d=\"M727 316H941M729 316V129\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C9DBDF\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"754\" y=\"183\" width=\"34\" height=\"133\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#188B7D\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"747\" y=\"320\" width=\"48\" height=\"8\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#D3E5E6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"814\" y=\"231\" width=\"34\" height=\"85\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#DDAA52\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"807\" y=\"320\" width=\"48\" height=\"8\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#D3E5E6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"875\" y=\"314\" width=\"34\" height=\"2\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#C9DBDF\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"868\" y=\"320\" width=\"48\" height=\"8\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#D3E5E6\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"841\" y=\"353\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#627C88\" font-weight=\"680\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Weight reaches zero</text></svg></div><section class=\"fs2-code\" aria-label=\"Scikit-learn feature selection examples in cross-validation\"><div class=\"fs2-code-label\">PYTHON · COMPARE THREE SELECTORS INSIDE CV</div><pre><code>from sklearn.datasets import make_classification\nfrom sklearn.feature_selection import (\n    SelectKBest, mutual_info_classif, RFE, SelectFromModel\n)\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import cross_val_score\n\nX, y = make_classification(\n    n_samples=180, n_features=10, n_informative=5,\n    n_redundant=0, random_state=4\n)\nlr = LogisticRegression(max_iter=1000)\nselectors = {\n    \"MI\": SelectKBest(mutual_info_classif, k=5),\n    \"RFE\": RFE(LogisticRegression(max_iter=1000),\n               n_features_to_select=5),\n    \"L1\": SelectFromModel(LogisticRegression(\n          penalty=\"l1\", solver=\"liblinear\", C=1.0))\n}\nfor name, selector in selectors.items():\n    pipe = Pipeline([\n        (\"scale\", StandardScaler()),\n        (\"select\", selector),\n        (\"model\", lr)\n    ])\n    print(name, cross_val_score(pipe, X, y, cv=3).mean())</code></pre><p>The feature selector is refitted inside each cross-validation training fold. This example uses a synthetic classification dataset.</p></section></section>"
